{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This demo introduces the story\u2019s prologue: you\u2019ll learn how the protagonist ended up in these strange spaces.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161220/extras/8569d342b65147ff3f7d234ff26d4aa3.poster.avif?t=1762592766\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161220/extras/8569d342b65147ff3f7d234ff26d4aa3.webm?t=1762592766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161220/extras/8569d342b65147ff3f7d234ff26d4aa3.mp4?t=1762592766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreamcore: Rabbit Hole</strong> \u2014 a meditative game about diving into a dream world, inspired by dreamcore aesthetics and liminal spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location is a distinct place with its own atmosphere, architecture, and soundscape. Sometimes cozy, sometimes unsettling, but always slightly familiar\u2014like the memory of a dream or a place you feel you\u2019ve already been.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who it\u2019s for:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >anyone tired of the hustle and noise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >anyone who needs to \u201cswitch off\u201d and just roam</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fans of dreamcore, liminal spaces, and atmospheric walks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Here, the dream ends only when you decide to wake up.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4161220?t=1762592766","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4161220?t=1762592766","capsule_